usage: tego rules create [--name <agent>] [--agent <program>] [--preset <list>] [--write <dir>]... [<dir>]
   or: tego rules edit <agent | file>
   or: tego rules check <agent | file> [--json]
   or: tego rules learn <session> [--save <name> | --out <file>]
   or: tego rules history <agent | file> [--json]
   or: tego rules undo <agent | file> [<id>] [--yes]
   or: tego rules <session> | --last [--json]

   create           Create a rules file in a project
   edit             Edit a rules file, then check it
   check            Check a rules file and show what it enforces
   learn            Create a rules file from what a session did
   history          Show the changes made to a rules file
   undo             Undo the newest change to a rules file

See 'tego help rules <command>' to read about a specific command.
